  "description": "After celebrating her new job at her favorite idol Chan Lee’s company, Da-Reum wakes up to a nightmare: the man she drunkenly attacked while defending her oppa is actually Hagi Kang, the company’s CEO. And Chan? He barely comes to the office at all. With only one shot at seeing Chan up close, an exclusive overseas company retreat, Da-Reum tries to cozy up to Hagi. But her attempts to stay on the CEO’s good side only convince him that she’s fallen for him. Even worse, Chan mistakes her nerves for hostility when they finally meet. A fangirl, two powerful men, and one growing misunderstanding. Da-Reum’s dream romance might end before it even begins.\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
